OL,3,GNEWSATwo teenagers arrested over RNLI
OL,4,Aquad bike theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of taking an RNLI quad bike
OL,8,Ffrom the promenade in Whitby.
OL,10,FThe vehicle was reported as stolen at
OL,11,Fabout 17:20 BST on Saturday, a
OL,12,Fspokesperson for North Yorkshire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FFollowing enquiries, the two teenagers
OL,16,Fwere arrested and have since been
OL,17,Freleased on conditional bail.
OL,19,FHowever, the vehicle remains missing
OL,20,Fand enquiries were "ongoing to locate
OL,21,Fand recover the quad bike," the
OL,22,Fspokesperson added.
